<view class="page {{pending ? 'has-actions' : ''}}">
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="notice">正在核对本人及当前有权赛事的数据授权…</view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice danger" role="alert">{{error}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{message}}" class="notice">{{message}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{loginRequired}}" class="card empty"><view class="title">登录后管理比赛数据授权</view><view class="muted">仅读取本人或当前有权管理赛事的授权记录。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="login">登录并返回数据授权</button></view>
  <block wx:if="{{authorized}}">
    <block wx:if="{{pending}}">
      <view class="page-title">{{pending.title}}</view>
      <view class="card"><view class="subtitle">请核对关联对象</view><view class="row">赛事：{{pending.link.eventName}}</view><view class="row">球队：{{pending.link.teamName}}</view><view class="row">固定名单成员：{{pending.link.memberName}}</view><view class="row">目标球员档案：{{pending.link.profileName}}</view></view>
      <view class="card"><view class="subtitle">有限公开范围</view><view class="row muted">只公开本人有限赛事名称、日期、赛制与得分 / 犯规、样本口径及完整度。</view><view class="row muted">不公开其他名单、身份证、联系方式、保单或私有赛事接口。</view></view>
      <view wx:if="{{pending.type === 'CONSENT'}}" class="card"><view class="subtitle">本人明确同意</view><checkbox-group bindchange="playerConsent"><label class="consent"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{pending.consent}}" disabled="{{busy || pendingUnknown}}" />我确认这是本人的参赛记录，并同意按上述有限范围公开</label></checkbox-group><view class="notice authorization-section">授权不等于立即有个人统计，仍须有当前有效、独立确认的个人记录。</view></view>
      <view wx:else class="notice warning">拒绝或撤销后，下次读取不再纳入该来源；不能收回别人此前已经看见或保存的内容。重新公开需要主办方重新提名与本人再次同意。</view>
      <view class="card"><view class="field-label">处理原因</view><textarea class="field authorization-reason" value="{{pending.reason}}" bindinput="dialogReason" maxlength="500" disabled="{{busy || pendingUnknown}}" placeholder="填写2至500字；不要包含私密证件或联系方式" /></view>
      <view wx:if="{{pendingUnknown}}" class="notice warning">原处理结果待核对，已保留原编号及内容。继续核对会重放原操作，不生成新的授权处理。</view>
      <view class="action-bar"><button class="primary" bindtap="submitDialog" disabled="{{busy || (!pendingUnknown &amp;&amp; (pending.reason.length &lt; 2 || (pending.type === 'CONSENT' &amp;&amp; !pending.consent)))}}">{{busy ? '正在核对…' : pendingUnknown ? '核对原处理结果' : '确认处理'}}</button><button class="quiet" bindtap="closeDialog" disabled="{{busy || pendingUnknown}}">返回授权列表</button></view>
    </block>
    <block wx:else>
      <view class="hero"><view class="title">{{ownOnly ? '我的比赛数据授权' : '比赛数据授权与提名'}}</view><view>服务资料和比赛记录，各自有来源。</view></view>
      <view class="notice authorization-section">{{disclosureNotice}}</view>
      <view class="authorization-tabs">
        <button class="chip {{filter === 'ALL' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-filter="ALL" bindtap="filter" disabled="{{dirty || busy || pageLoading || sourceLoading || checking || nominationUnknown}}">全部历史</button>
        <button class="chip {{filter === 'PENDING' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-filter="PENDING" bindtap="filter" disabled="{{dirty || busy || pageLoading || sourceLoading || checking || nominationUnknown}}">待本人确认</button>
        <button class="chip {{filter === 'APPROVED' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-filter="APPROVED" bindtap="filter" disabled="{{dirty || busy || pageLoading || sourceLoading || checking || nominationUnknown}}">已同意</button>
        <button class="chip {{filter === 'REVOKED' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-filter="REVOKED" bindtap="filter" disabled="{{dirty || busy || pageLoading || sourceLoading || checking || nominationUnknown}}">已拒绝 / 撤销</button>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{!links.length}}" class="card empty"><view class="subtitle">本页暂无符合条件的记录</view><view class="muted">当前页没有本人记录时，仍可继续加载完整历史。较早有效授权不会因新记录增多而失去撤销入口。</view><button wx:if="{{ownOnly &amp;&amp; !ownProfileId}}" class="secondary" bindtap="center">查看本人球员档案</button></view>
      <view wx:for="{{links}}" wx:key="id" class="card authorization-card">
        <view class="row-between"><view class="subtitle">{{item.eventName}}</view><text class="badge">{{item.statusText}}</text></view>
        <view class="row">{{item.teamName}} · 固定名单成员：{{item.memberName}}</view>
        <view class="row">球员档案：{{item.profileName}}</view>
        <view class="row muted">{{item.createdText}} · {{item.sourceText}}</view>
        <view wx:if="{{!item.sourceCurrentlyAvailable}}" class="notice warning">当前来源不再满足公开条件。个人统计不会回退到旧确认；可以按当前权限处理撤销。</view>
        <view class="authorization-actions">
          <button wx:if="{{item.capabilities.canConsent}}" class="primary" bindtap="checkLink" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-type="CONSENT" disabled="{{dirty || busy || pageLoading || sourceLoading || checking || nominationUnknown}}">核对本人记录并同意</button>
          <button wx:if="{{item.capabilities.canRevoke}}" class="secondary" bindtap="checkLink" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-type="REVOKE" disabled="{{dirty || busy || pageLoading || sourceLoading || checking || nominationUnknown}}">{{item.revokeText}}</button>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{checking}}" class="notice">正在重新核对这条记录的当前权限与版本…</view>
      <view wx:if="{{pageError}}" class="notice warning">{{pageError}}</view>
      <button wx:if="{{linksHasMore}}" class="secondary" bindtap="more" disabled="{{dirty || busy || loading || pageLoading || sourceLoading || checking || nominationUnknown}}">{{pageLoading ? '正在加载…' : pageError ? '重试加载同一页历史' : '加载更多授权历史'}}</button>
      <view class="muted small authorization-footer">每次读取50条，直到全部有权历史加载完毕。每次操作前重新读取当前记录；授权不授予私有赛事接口权限。</view>
      <button class="quiet" bindtap="refresh" disabled="{{dirty || busy || pageLoading || sourceLoading || checking || nominationUnknown}}">刷新数据授权</button>

      <view wx:if="{{!ownOnly}}" class="authorization-section">
        <view class="card"><view class="subtitle">主办方提名本人参赛记录</view><view class="muted">由当前有赛事数据管理权的主办方精确选择固定名单成员；不能按同名自动认领。平台身份不会自动获得发布权。</view>
          <view wx:if="{{!manageableEvents.length}}" class="notice">当前没有可管理数据授权的赛事。</view>
          <block wx:else>
            <view class="nomination-field"><view class="field-label">有权管理的赛事</view><picker range="{{manageableEvents}}" range-key="name" value="{{eventIndex &lt; 0 ? 0 : eventIndex}}" bindchange="chooseEvent" disabled="{{busy || pageLoading || checking || nominationUnknown}}"><view class="nomination-picker">{{selectedEvent || '请选择赛事'}}</view></picker></view>
            <view wx:if="{{sourceLoading}}" class="notice">正在读取该届明确报名名单…</view>
            <button wx:if="{{selectedEvent &amp;&amp; !sourceLoading &amp;&amp; !teams.length}}" class="quiet" bindtap="retrySources" disabled="{{busy || nominationUnknown}}">重新读取所选赛事名单</button>
            <view class="nomination-field"><view class="field-label">所属球队</view><picker range="{{teams}}" range-key="name" value="{{teamIndex &lt; 0 ? 0 : teamIndex}}" bindchange="chooseTeam" disabled="{{busy || sourceLoading || nominationUnknown || !teams.length}}"><view class="nomination-picker">{{selectedTeam || '先选择赛事，再选择球队'}}</view></picker></view>
            <view class="nomination-field"><view class="field-label">固定报名名单成员</view><picker range="{{members}}" range-key="label" value="{{memberIndex &lt; 0 ? 0 : memberIndex}}" bindchange="chooseMember" disabled="{{busy || sourceLoading || nominationUnknown || !members.length}}"><view class="nomination-picker">{{selectedMember || '请选择明确的名单成员'}}</view></picker></view>
            <view class="nomination-field"><view class="field-label">提名到已审核球员档案</view><picker range="{{profiles}}" range-key="displayName" value="{{profileIndex &lt; 0 ? 0 : profileIndex}}" bindchange="chooseProfile" disabled="{{busy || sourceLoading || nominationUnknown || !profiles.length}}"><view class="nomination-picker">{{selectedProfile || '请选择已审核档案并核对编号'}}</view></picker></view>
            <view class="muted small authorization-section">档案列表为当前最多200条已审核资料；未找到时先核对档案状态，不能仅凭同名替代。</view>
            <view class="nomination-field"><view class="field-label">提名依据与原因</view><textarea class="field authorization-reason" value="{{draft.reason}}" bindinput="draftReason" maxlength="500" disabled="{{busy || nominationUnknown}}" placeholder="填写2至500字，说明如何核对对象；不要填身份证、联系方式或保单" /></view>
            <checkbox-group bindchange="publisherConsent"><label class="consent"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{draft.publisherConsent}}" disabled="{{busy || sourceLoading || nominationUnknown}}" />我确认有权提供本次名单成员的有限比赛统计</label></checkbox-group>
            <view class="notice">提名后等待球员本人单独同意，尚不公开，也不修改冻结名单。一个账号兼任两角色时仍须分别执行，不等于双人实名核验。</view>
            <view wx:if="{{nominationUnknown}}" class="notice warning">原提名结果待核对，当前内容已锁定；继续使用原编号核对，不换号重复提名。</view>
            <button class="primary" bindtap="nominate" disabled="{{busy || sourceLoading || (!nominationUnknown &amp;&amp; (!draft.publisherConsent || !draft.eventId || !draft.teamId || !draft.memberId || !draft.profileId || draft.reason.length &lt; 2))}}">{{busy ? '正在处理…' : nominationUnknown ? '核对原提名结果' : '提名给球员本人确认'}}</button>
            <button class="quiet" bindtap="discardDraft" disabled="{{busy || sourceLoading || nominationUnknown}}">放弃当前未提交草稿</button>
          </block>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{dirty || nominationUnknown}}" class="notice warning">编辑草稿或确认记录期间暂停刷新和历史分页，避免丢失输入。先完成或关闭当前操作。</view>
    </block>
  </block>
  <button wx:if="{{!loading &amp;&amp; !authorized &amp;&amp; !loginRequired}}" class="secondary" bindtap="refresh">重新读取数据授权</button>
</view>
